<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/levin-2014-tumor-11--gpt> a <https://w3id.org/delphi/ontology/LLMClaimAssessment>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "GPT-5.6 Sol on levin-2014-tumor-11: needs-new-data, resolvability 0.41";
    dc:description "The mechanism makes specific spatial predictions but the necessary bacterial, butyrate, and acetylation maps were not collected. Existing tumor-incidence data cannot distinguish this model from alternative microbiome or HDAC pathways.";
    dc:subject <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/dataset-resolvability-0.2.0>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Proposed test with existing data: Image or sequence butyrate-producing bacteria spatially relative to hyperpolarized and oncogene-expressing cells, measure local butyrate and histone acetylation, and manipulate surface charge independently of Vmem. The full predicted spatial chain must co-vary.";
    prov:wasAttributedTo <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/agent/delphisci-resolvability-assessor-gpt-5.6-sol-medium>;
    <https://w3id.org/delphi/ontology/assessmentType> "dataset-resolvability/0.2.0";
    <https://w3id.org/delphi/ontology/evidenceAgainst> "Antibiotic effects do not establish spatial redistribution.", "Surface charge and Vmem effects are confounded.", "The paper explicitly lacked in vivo butyrate localization and bacterial culture tools.";
    <https://w3id.org/delphi/ontology/hasConfidence> "0.9"^^xsd:double;
    <https://w3id.org/delphi/ontology/hasScore> "0.408"^^xsd:double;
